Chapter: LinLaunderReturn
  cites Foreword chapter Linear

 Probe (closed by LinearOwnership stage 3): returning the linear
 param from a function typed with a plain return is an unsanctioned
 freeze - CDX2066. Declare the return linear, or consume the value
 with freeze, the one door with a name.

Section: Definitions

  launder : linear Integer -> Integer
  launder (n) = n

  opening : Text = let x = launder 5
   in show (x + x)

